金額",null,"0ahUKEwjTvaC_wNKWAxU2afUHHXdrAwIQ3IcHCE0oBA",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["算老顧客嗎，從大學吃到出社會一直在吃\n深知體會到現在物價上漲的可怕，但味道依舊美味\n但是湯量比以往還要鮮少許多，雖然還是夠吃兩球麵的量，但對於喜歡喝湯的來說可能會稍顯可惜，從300到380的SP干貝濃湯的價格來看，原物料上漲能理解，口味也還是一致，但這價位已經會猶豫要不要再加點配料或是其他的配菜了，美味程度可以給滿分，但以現在的排隊狀況與價格來看，在心理層面的分數可能扣了好幾分了\n但還是推薦大家來吃，如果剛發薪可以來吃一碗彌補一下心情\n抄手醬汁好吃，喜歡重口味一點的可以搭配麵來當沾麵轉味吃看看",null,[0,41]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnROZDJSSVFqWlVWVlUxVEZSa2NXRXphRTVOYlhSWFV6QTFVRTFWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnROZDJSSVFqWlVWVlUxVEZSa2NXRXphRTVOYlhSWFV6QTFVRTFWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnROZDJSSVFqWlVWVlUxVEZSa2NXRXphRTVOYlhSWFV6QTFVRTFWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnROZDJSSVFqWlVWVlUxVEZSa2NXRXphRTVOYlhSWFV6QTFVRTFWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnROZDJSSVFqWlVWVlUxVEZSa2NXRXphRTVOYlhSWFV6QTFVRTFWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnROZDJSSVFqWlVWVlUxVEZSa2NXRXphRTVOYlhSWFV6QTFVRTFWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,4149,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tNd2RIQjZUVVU1TFRkcWEzaE5NbXRXUzA1UE1VRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xce274ce69131b5b8!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkMwdHB6TUU5LTdqa3hNMmtWS05PMUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tNd2RIQjZUVVU1TFRkcWEzaE5NbXRXUzA1UE1VRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026enti