些轉味的功能。\n\n湯汁很好的扒附麵條，甚至有點像白醬拌麵的程度，很愉快地吃到最後一口。吃了一口同事的加麵：九州全粒粉（偏硬），真的硬滿多的，不是我的菜。\n\n配菜有玉米、紫洋蔥，效果不錯，增加滿好的口感，但可惜沒有什麼轉味元素，尤其是湯那麼濃的時候。\n\n整體好吃，下次想再回來吃蝦清湯麵。",null,[0,79]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRhYWxWWFRuaGhXR1JxVjBNeFRWUXpUa3hNVlU1elZsaGFZVXhWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRhYWxWWFRuaGhXR1JxVjBNeFRWUXpUa3hNVlU1elZsaGFZVXhWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRhYWxWWFRuaGhXR1JxVjBNeFRWUXpUa3hNVlU1elZsaGFZVXhWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRhYWxWWFRuaGhXR1JxVjBNeFRWUXpUa3hNVlU1elZsaGFZVXhWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRhYWxWWFRuaGhXR1JxVjBNeFRWUXpUa3hNVlU1elZsaGFZVXhWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRhYWxWWFRuaGhXR1JxVjBNeFRWUXpUa3hNVlU1elZsaGFZVXhWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,8382,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taalVXTnhhWGRqV0MxTVQzTkxMVU5zVlhaYUxVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xce274ce69131b5b8!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkZjUWNxaXdjWC1MT3NLLUNsVXZaLUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taalVXTnhhWGRqV0MxTVQzTkxMVU5zVlhaYUxVRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taalVXTnhhWGRqV0MxTVQzTkxMVU5zVlhaYUxVRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taalVXTnhhWGRqV0MxTVQzTkxMVU5zVlhaYUxVRRILMGRrY1NtbkR2VXQaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rWmpVV054YVhkaldDMU1UM05MTFVOc1ZYWmFMVUUSCzBka2NTbW5EdlV0