鮮美硬度剛好，水準也不錯。\n湯頭是清爽系不是濃郁系，有淡淡的龍蝦香；但選了麵硬好像還是軟趴趴，有待加強呀。整體來說個別的食材都不錯吃，但合在一起融合感不足，基本上就只是把高級食材加進拉麵混在一起而已，以這個價格可以再用心點。\n紅油抄手(4顆50元)和分店湮鯱的一樣好吃，應該是一樣的東西，值得加點，抄手內餡飽滿不膩口，沾上辣度輕的紅油和醋味，好吃又無負擔。",null,[0,90]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHUjFkVk5WaFNNRlpTWVRCb1NVMHhSazFoVldoUFRrVnNWMDVZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHUjFkVk5WaFNNRlpTWVRCb1NVMHhSazFoVldoUFRrVnNWMDVZWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHUjFkVk5WaFNNRlpTWVRCb1NVMHhSazFoVldoUFRrVnNWMDVZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHUjFkVk5WaFNNRlpTWVRCb1NVMHhSazFoVldoUFRrVnNWMDVZWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHUjFkVk5WaFNNRlpTWVRCb1NVMHhSazFoVldoUFRrVnNWMDVZWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHUjFkVk5WaFNNRlpTWVRCb1NVMHhSazFoVldoUFRrVnNWMDVZWXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,28275,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGR1dVNVhSMFZSYTBoSU0xRk1hVWhPTkVsV05YYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xce274ce69131b5b8!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkFGWU5XR0VRa0hIM1FMaUhONElWNXc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGR1dVNVhSMFZSYTBoSU0xRk1hVWhPTkVsV05YYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGR1dVNVhSMFZSYTBoSU0xRk1hVWhPTkVsV05YYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGR1dVNVhSMFZSYTBoSU0xRk1hVWhPTkVsV05YYxILMGRWcUpXZjF6NE0aPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09rRkdXVTVYUjBWUmEwaElNMUZN