n玉米真的是畫龍點睛，多了顆粒的口感\n\n11:15到大概等20-30分鐘\n店內只有八個座位偏小但木頭裝潢很日本\n廁所門偏矮，一個不注意就撞到頭\n使用POS機買卷同時有順序所以不用排隊等\n店員非常有熱情服務也非常到位\n有點可惜的是吃拉麵配K-pop有點影響用餐體驗\n整體是非常高水準優秀的店家，價格也不貴\n我絕對會再訪嘗試別的口味，也非常推薦！",null,[0,22]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvZEZOclNUSmhNMUpYV1ZVeGExTnRkSEJYUlRsNVdESndhMk5WUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvZEZOclNUSmhNMUpYV1ZVeGExTnRkSEJYUlRsNVdESndhMk5WUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvZEZOclNUSmhNMUpYV1ZVeGExTnRkSEJYUlRsNVdESndhMk5WUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvZEZOclNUSmhNMUpYV1ZVeGExTnRkSEJYUlRsNVdESndhMk5WUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvZEZOclNUSmhNMUpYV1ZVeGExTnRkSEJYUlRsNVdESndhMk5WUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1762333081755287181/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFvZEZOclNUSmhNMUpYV1ZVeGExTnRkSEJYUlRsNVdESndhMk5WUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,3337,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21odFNrSTJhM1JXWVUxa1NtdHBXRTl5WDJwa2NVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xce274ce69131b5b8!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmhtSkI2a3RWYU1kSmtpWE9yX2pkcUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21odFNrSTJhM1JXWVUxa1NtdHBXRTl5WDJwa2NVRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21odFNrSTJhM1JXWVUxa1NtdHBXRTl5WDJwa2NVRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21odFNrSTJhM1JXWVUxa1NtdHBXRTl5WDJwa2NVRRILMGR5NDNMUnNjLTkaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09taHRTa0kyYTNSV1lVMWtTbXRwV